    36	  `CS:IntSeq`. Non-string values and alternate initial bindings are excluded.
    37	- Observable final state: the `<k>` result is exactly `isLen(CS)`; `<exc>` is
    38	  `NoExc`; `<exit-code>` is 0. Environment, scope allocation, heap, stack, and
